cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, code, or figures, please cite the
  accompanying article and this deposit.
title: "Procopius Frequency Analysis: Data and Code"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic Python pipeline and derived dataset for the
  whole-corpus frequency analysis of ethnonyms in Procopius
  of Caesarea's History of the Wars (Books I-VIII) and the
  opening of the Anecdota, based on the Loeb edition (Dewing
  1914-1940). Includes per-book counts for 46 attested
  groups, log-likelihood G² statistics, and three figures.
